    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "VAAN (formerly The Vaan Group) is a New York-based design and technology studio specializing in Shopify ecommerce for premium and luxury DTC brands. Their \"Brand Conversion Design\" framework blends brand identity, UX, and performance in a single discipline; clients include Rhode, HexClad, Stadium Goods, Hourglass, and Makeup by Mario. Founded around 2015, headquartered in Brooklyn/New York; LinkedIn lists 11-50 employees, PitchBook cites up to 76, likely 40-80 range pre-acquisition. CEO Xavier Armand led the studio until Verndale acquired them in January 2026; the vaangroup.com domain still operates independently but the entity is now part of Verndale. Autonomy 4: operates as an integrated creative-and-build studio, not a sole operator, but small enough to be highly execution-focused; Jonathan would engage them as a specialist studio partner.",
